      ⟨⟨ok_reg hGu, ok_reg hGv⟩, trivial, ⟨Δ, rfl⟩⟩ ⟨⟨trivial, trivial⟩, trivial⟩
      ⟨⟨bnd_reg hGu (by omega), bnd_reg hGv (by omega), by
